 * ------------------
 * A rule is a JSON object with one of these shapes:
 *
 *   Comparison  { "field": "<dot.path>", "op": "<operator>", "value": <literal> }
 *   Logical AND { "all": [ <rule>, ... ] }
 *   Logical OR  { "any": [ <rule>, ... ] }
 *   Logical NOT { "not": <rule> }
 *
